# 中文说明：仅在 FIRE 松弛后 Fmax<=0.01 eV/Angstrom 时单独运行本文件。
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data minimized.data
pair_style pace
pair_coeff * * model.yace Ag C Si Ti
neighbor 2.0 bin
timestep 0.0001
velocity all create 300.0 20261123 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integ all nve
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal
run 1000
